      "raw": "<p>I placed a -1 damage on Miss Information in a recent game, but as I played, I had to second guess how I was applying the reduction because several of her cards mention that hero targets deal themselves damage i.e. &quot;Misplaced Memo: Each target deals itself 2 psychic damage.&quot; &nbsp;Would the the -1 to damage reduction be in effect because the cause of the damage stems from one of Miss Information&#39;s cards, or would there be no reduction because the hero targets are dealing the damage to themselves? &nbsp;I&#39;m leaning towards the latter, but I thought I&#39;d ask.</p>",
