      "created_at": "2014-08-25T02:17:00.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>No reduction. You apply all of the modifiers of the target dealing the damage and the target receiving the damage. It doesn’t matter why or how that attack was initiated, as that source is irrelevant for modifiers.</p>",
